EMail Dir:

The directory your private messages (EMail) will be
sent to. NOTE: please ensure this is not the same
               directory you indicated in the Message
               Dir above.

(eg: Work:Email)

Please remember you can only have the computer create
one directory. This means that if you indicate:

   Work:terminal/vbbs

and the 'vbbs' directory doesn't exist, then VBBSMenu
will create it for you. If on the other hand you
indicated:

   Work:vbbs/messages

and 'vbbs' and 'messages' directories do not exist.
neither will be created. 

